#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:12(title)
#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:17(tertiary)
#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:20(primary)
#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:89(title)
msgid "Filmstrip"
msgstr "Filmremsa"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:24(title)
#: src/filters/combine/depthmerge.xml:31(title)
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Översikt"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:26(title)
msgid "Applying example for the Filmstrip filter"
msgstr "Exempel på hur filtret Filmremsa används"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:33(para)
#: src/filters/combine/depthmerge.xml:40(para)
msgid "Original image"
msgstr "Ursprunglig bild"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:42(para)
#: src/filters/combine/depthmerge.xml:49(para)
msgid "Filter applied"
msgstr "Filtret har tillämpats"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:46(para)
msgid ""
"Filmstrip filter lets you merge several pictures into a photographic film "
"drawing."
msgstr ""
"Filtret Filmremsa sammanfogar flera bilder till en illustration av en "
"fotografisk filmremsa."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:51(para)
msgid ""
"This filter does not invert colors, so it does not imitate negative film "
"like the ones used to produce prints. Instead you should think of the result"
" as an imitation of slide film or cinema film."
msgstr ""
"Filtret inverterar inte färgerna och efterliknar därför inte ett filmnegativ"
" som används för att framställa papperskopior. Resultatet liknar i stället "
"en diabildsfilm eller biograffilm."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:56(para)
msgid ""
"The drawing is a new separate image instance which would need to be saved "
"separately, not a layer in any existing image."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet är en ny, fristående bild som måste sparas separat. Det blir inte"
" ett lager i någon av de befintliga bilderna."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:63(title)
#: src/filters/combine/depthmerge.xml:76(title)
msgid "Activating the Filter"
msgstr "Aktivera filtret"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:64(para)
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the main menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Combine</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Filmstrip…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Kombinera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Filmremsa…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:75(title)
#: src/filters/combine/depthmerge.xml:88(title)
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Alternativ"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:78(title)
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Markering"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:80(title)
msgid "<quote>Filmstrip</quote> filter options (Selection)"
msgstr "Alternativ för filtret <quote>Filmremsa</quote> (bildurval)"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:91(term)
msgid "Fit height to images"
msgstr "Anpassa höjden till bilderna"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:93(para)
msgid "Applies the height of original pictures to the resulting one."
msgstr "Anpassar filmremsans höjd efter originalbildernas höjd."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:99(term)
msgid "Film height"
msgstr "Filmhöjd"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:101(para)
msgid ""
"This option lets you define the height of the resulting picture. If "
"originals have different sizes, they will be scaled to this size."
msgstr ""
"Med det här alternativet anger du höjden på den färdiga bilden. Om "
"originalbilderna har olika mått skalas de till den angivna höjden."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:109(term)
msgid "Film color"
msgstr "Filmfärg"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:111(para)
msgid ""
"By clicking on the color button you can define the color of the film (around"
" and between pictures)."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på färgknappen för att välja filmremsans färg runt bilderna och "
"mellan dem."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:119(title)
msgid "Numbering"
msgstr "Numrering"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:121(term)
msgid "Start index"
msgstr "Startindex"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:123(para)
msgid "Defines the beginning number which will be used for the images."
msgstr "Anger startnumret för bilderna."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:130(term)
msgid "Number font"
msgstr "Siffertypsnitt"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:132(para)
msgid "Defines the font of digits."
msgstr "Anger teckensnittet för siffrorna."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:136(term)
msgid "Number color"
msgstr "Sifferfärg"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:138(para)
msgid ""
"By clicking on the color button, you can define the font color of digits."
msgstr "Klicka på färgknappen för att välja siffrornas färg."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:145(term)
msgid "At top"
msgstr "Överst"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:146(term)
msgid "At bottom"
msgstr "Nederst"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:148(para)
msgid "Defines the position of the number."
msgstr "Anger var numret ska placeras."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:153(title)
msgid "Image Selection"
msgstr "Bildurval"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:155(term)
msgid "Available images"
msgstr "Tillgängliga bilder"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:157(para)
msgid ""
"Shows the pictures which can be used for merging. The pictures are the ones "
"already opened in GIMP."
msgstr ""
"Visar de bilder som kan sammanfogas. Listan innehåller bilder som redan är "
"öppna i GIMP."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:164(term)
msgid "On film"
msgstr "I filmremsan"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:166(para)
msgid "Shows the pictures chosen to be merged."
msgstr "Visar bilderna som ska ingå i filmremsan."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:170(term)
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Lägg till"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:172(para)
msgid ""
"This button allows the user to put an available image in the <quote>On "
"film</quote> section."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen lägger du till en tillgänglig bild i avsnittet <quote>I "
"filmremsan</quote>."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:179(term)
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Ta bort"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:181(para)
msgid ""
"This button allows to bring a picture from <quote>On film</quote> to "
"<quote>Available images</quote>. After that, the picture will not be used "
"anymore in the resulting document."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen flyttar du tillbaka en bild från <quote>I "
"filmremsan</quote> till <quote>Tillgängliga bilder</quote>. Bilden tas då "
"bort från resultatet."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:192(title)
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avancerat"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:194(title)
msgid "<quote>Filmstrip</quote> filter options (Advanced)"
msgstr "Alternativ för filtret <quote>Filmremsa</quote> (avancerat)"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:204(term)
msgid "Image height"
msgstr "Bildhöjd"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:206(para)
msgid "Defines the height of each picture in the resulting image."
msgstr "Anger höjden på varje bild i resultatet."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:212(term)
msgid "Image spacing"
msgstr "Bildmellanrum"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:214(para)
msgid ""
"Defines the space between the pictures as they will be inserted in the "
"future image."
msgstr "Anger avståndet mellan bilderna i resultatet."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:221(term)
msgid "Hole offset"
msgstr "Hålposition"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:223(para)
msgid "Defines the hole position from image border."
msgstr "Anger avståndet från bildkanten till hålen."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:229(term)
msgid "Hole width"
msgstr "Hålbredd"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:231(para)
msgid "Defines the width of the holes in the resulting image."
msgstr "Anger hålens bredd i resultatet."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:237(term)
msgid "Hole height"
msgstr "Hålhöjd"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:239(para)
msgid "Defines the height of the holes in the resulting image."
msgstr "Anger hålens höjd i resultatet."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:245(term)
msgid "Hole distance"
msgstr "Hålavstånd"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:247(para)
msgid "Defines the space between holes."
msgstr "Anger avståndet mellan hålen."

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:251(term)
msgid "Number height"
msgstr "Sifferhöjd"

#: src/filters/combine/filmstrip.xml:253(para)
msgid ""
"Defines the height of the index number, proportionally to the height of the "
"picture."
msgstr "Anger numrets höjd i förhållande till bildens höjd."

